  "yearLabel": "元（约）",
  "form": "曲·幺",
  "genre": "曲",
  "themes": [],
  "place": null,
  "text": "虚设，玉笋频搓，绣鞋重扌颠。",
  "pinyin": "xū shè ， yù sǔn pín cuō ， xiù xié zhòng shou diān 。",
