  "genre": "文",
  "themes": [],
  "place": null,
  "text": "公都子曰：「外人皆称夫子好辩，敢问何也？」",
  "pinyin": "gōng dōu zi yuē ： 「 wài rén jiē chēng fū zǐ hǎo biàn ， gǎn wèn hé yě ？ 」",
  "translation": "",
  "notes": [],
  "appreciation": "",
